<title>USA: Stericycle names Frank ten Brink CFO.</title>
<headline>Stericycle names Frank ten Brink CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stericycle Inc said it named Frank ten Brink chief financial officer and chief administrative officer.</p>
<p>Ten Brink was formerly chief financial officer of Telular Corp, said the medical waste handling company.</p>
<p>He replaces James Polark, who will remain with Stericycle as central region vice president, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
